Package: MetTarget
Title: Metabolic Target Identification
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Lu Zhang, Yingnan Han, Heming Xing, Andre Kurlovs, and MetTarget Team
Maintainer: Lu Zhang <lu.zhang3@sanofi.com>
Description: MetTarget is a machine learning framework for prioritizing immunometabolic therapeutic targets in inflammatory bowel disease (IBD). It integrates public genetics, bulk RNA-seq, and single-cell RNA-seq data to score and rank candidate targets in Crohn's disease (CD) and ulcerative colitis (UC).
Imports:
    circlize,
    ComplexHeatmap,
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    openxlsx,
    RColorBrewer,
    reshape2,
    scales,
    tidyr
